### Record Unique Story View
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stories/view
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "story_id": 1,
  "viewer_id": "user_101"
}

### Record Reaction / Reply
POST http://localhost:5000/api/stories/interact
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "story_id": 1,
  "user_id": "user_101",
  "type": "reaction",
  "content": "❤️"
}

### Get Story Analytics Dashboard
GET http://localhost:5000/api/stories/1/analytics 